   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz7R3",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "I am asking you to give your party vote to ACT. I want what NZ needs, where more ACT MPs will fight to cut waste and balance the books, prevent new taxes, staunchly defend equal rights, deliver better public services, cut red tape, and restore real consequences for crime. I'm asking those in the East Cape electorate to choose whichever candidate you believe will best represent our region, and give your party vote to ACT."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz7TE",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "I'm consistently driven to listen and achieve objectives to improve our region and country. I trust Act representatives to ethically represent, and I put NZ ahead of personal ambition.  I'm asking you to give your party vote to ACT to Lock Labour Out. This will ensure we keep the current coalition Government in power to continue recovery and rebuild further and faster on the issues that make a better life for you. Party vote ACT."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz7VP",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Balance the books & grow the economy with no new taxes so incomes rise faster than living costs."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz7Xa",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Deliver better services for taxpayers: education, police, and match Australia on medicines funding."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoz7Zl",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Make decisions based on need, not race. Work towards one law for all and one future together."
     }
    ],
